      "title": "Think-on-Graph: Deep and Responsible Reasoning of Large Language Model with Knowledge Graph",
      "page_start": 1,
      "page_end": 1,
      "source_relative_path": "Methods/215_Think-on-Graph Deep and Responsible Reasoning of Large Language Model with Knowledge Graph.pdf",
      "source_spans": [
